---
import DocsLayout from '../../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Tutorials - Dasher">
  <h1>Tutorials</h1>

  <p>Welcome to the Dasher tutorials. These step-by-step guides will help you learn how to use Dasher effectively.</p>

  <div class="tutorial-list">
    <section class="tutorial-card">
      <h2>Getting Started with Dasher</h2>
      <p>Learn the basics of Dasher and how to start writing text efficiently.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/docs/getting-started/install/">Installation</a> - Install Dasher on your platform</li>
        <li><a href="/docs/getting-started/how-to/tips/">Tips for Novices</a> - Essential tips for beginners</li>
        <li><a href="/docs/getting-started/how-to/manual/part1/">Manual Part 1</a> - Introduction to Dasher</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="tutorial-card">
      <h2>Advanced Usage</h2>
      <p>Take your Dasher skills to the next level with advanced techniques.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/docs/getting-started/how-to/manual/part3/">Personalizing Dasher</a> - Customize alphabet, colors, and training</li>
        <li><a href="/docs/getting-started/how-to/manual/part6/">Continuous Gestures</a> - Using joysticks, head-tracking, and eye-tracking</li>
        <li><a href="/docs/getting-started/how-to/manual/part7/">Button Modes</a> - Alternative input methods</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="tutorial-card">
      <h2>Special Topics</h2>
      <p>Explore specialized topics and use cases.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/docs/getting-started/how-to/manual/part4/">Languages</a> - Using Dasher in different languages</li>
        <li><a href="/docs/research/publications/">Research Publications</a> - Academic background on Dasher</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="video-section">
    <h2>Video Tutorials</h2>
    <p>See Dasher in action with our video demonstrations:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://www.dasher.org.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Dasher Movies and Demos</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://video.google.com/videoplay?docid=5078334075080674416" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Tech Talk (54 minutes)</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>

<style>
  .tutorial-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .tutorial-card {
    background-color: var(--color-canvas-white);
    border: 2px solid var(--color-horizon-mint);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .tutorial-card h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    color: var(--color-deep-ink);
  }

  .tutorial-card ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .tutorial-card li {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .video-section {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    background-color: var(--color-horizon-mint);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  }

  .video-section h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  ul {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: var(--space-lg);
  }

  li {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  a {
    color: var(--color-deep-ink);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  a:hover {
    color: var(--color-target-coral);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
